{"id":"wb-1-47","name":"石钟山石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"石钟山石窟","text":"石钟山石窟，又称石宝山石窟，位于云南省大理白族自治州剑川县沙溪镇石钟山上，开凿于南诏中后期至大理国。因山上有大石如巨钟，因而得名石钟山。石窟分布于石钟寺、狮子关、沙登箐（qiàn），共17窟，造像233躯。造像题材有佛、菩萨、天王、明王、僧人、居士、供养人，以及南诏王及其侍臣、亲属等。造像具有浓郁的唐宋艺术风格及地方民族特色；多用圆刀技法，布局严谨而有层次，线条圆润流畅，人物身材匀称，带有生活气息。造像内容及雕刻技法上，与四川、重庆等地唐、宋石窟有较多相似处。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%B3%E9%92%9F%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":86484702,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86484702","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/735f24eadcca5b6c85d3edb9.jpg","title":"Shibaoshan_shizhongsi.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shibaoshan_shizhongsi.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/Shibaoshan_shizhongsi.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Halazhang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"远眺石钟寺（石窟）","width":320,"height":213}}